{"tool_name":"3d-nuclei-clustering-tool","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Analyze the clustering behavior of nuclei in 3D images. The centers of the nuclei are detected. The nuclei are filtered by the presence of a signal in a different channel. The clustering is done with the density based algorithm DBSCAN. The nearest neighbor distances between all nuclei and those outside and inside of the clusters are calculated.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Analyze the clustering behavior of nuclei in 3D images. The centers of the nuclei are detected. The nuclei are filtered by the presence of a signal in a different channel. The clustering is done with the density based algorithm DBSCAN. The nearest neighbor distances between all nuclei and those outside and inside of the clusters are calculated.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-24T14:22:20+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-09-22T15:59:35+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[{"cid":null,"comment_count":null,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":null,"last_comment_uid":null,"status":2}],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":5054,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"65ffdda7-db0a-41c7-8214-0c63fe71cd64","url":"/taxonomy/term/5054"},{"target_id":5055,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6d86ca72-cca7-43d1-821d-8a3a9325c785","url":"/taxonomy/term/5055"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1600792857,"last_comment_uid":42,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"B\u00e4cker Volker orcid.org/0000-0002-9129-6403"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5056,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"72236059-f437-462c-88d0-a8924fe71b2d","url":"/taxonomy/term/5056"},{"target_id":4846,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"767a7d66-a7ae-47e4-b2cd-5730124d2a36","u